- C-A sinter 2.0 mm, PAO-2 @ 65C 10.0 L/min: h_eff 18 kW/m2K, Rth 0.1065 K/W, dT_out 20.2 K, dP 2.6 kPa
- C-A sinter 2.0 mm, PAO-2 @ 65C 20.8 L/min: h_eff 20 kW/m2K, Rth 0.1021 K/W, dT_out 9.7 K, dP 11.2 kPa
- C-R sinter 1.0 mm, WEG 50/50 @ 65C 10.0 L/min: h_eff 108 kW/m2K, Rth 0.0561 K/W, dT_out 9.7 K, dP 3.2 kPa
- C-R sinter 1.0 mm, PAO-2 @ 65C 10.0 L/min: h_eff 49 kW/m2K, Rth 0.0738 K/W, dT_out 20.2 K, dP 2.9 kPa
- C-R sinter 1.0 mm, PAO-2 @ 65C 20.8 L/min: h_eff 51 kW/m2K, Rth 0.0725 K/W, dT_out 9.7 K, dP 11.9 kPa
- pin-fin, PAO-2 10 L/min: h_eff 7.1 kW/m2K, Rth 0.1736 K/W

